{{!
    @template mod_aibranchedscenario/debriefactions

    The actions that close a debrief: run it again, or keep a copy.

    They used to have a page of their own, whose only other content was a sentence saying
    the debrief had ended. They now sit at the foot of whichever page is last, so the deck
    ends on something worth reading.

    Context variables required for this template:
    * allowreplay bool Whether another attempt is allowed

    Example context (json):
    {
        "allowreplay": true
    }
}}
{{! The last row of the whole activity. It used to be two low-emphasis buttons of nearly
    equal weight, so the end of the scenario offered no way on that looked like one. Going
    again is the action and wears the accent; keeping a copy is a control beside it. }}
<div class="aibs-debrief-actions">
    {{#allowreplay}}
        <button type="button" class="aibs-btn aibs-btn-primary" data-action="replay">
            <svg class="aibs-icon" viewBox="0 0 20 20" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">
                <path d="M16.4 10a6.4 6.4 0 1 1-1.9-4.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor"
                      stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round"/>
                <path d="M16.6 2.9v3.4h-3.4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor"
                      stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
            </svg>
            {{#str}} tryagain, mod_aibranchedscenario {{/str}}
        </button>
    {{/allowreplay}}
    {{! The label is on the control rather than in it: the words took as much room as the
        action beside them and read as a second offer of equal weight. }}
    <button type="button" class="aibs-iconbtn" data-action="print"
            title="{{#str}} printdebrief, mod_aibranchedscenario {{/str}}"
            aria-label="{{#str}} printdebrief, mod_aibranchedscenario {{/str}}">
        <svg class="aibs-icon" viewBox="0 0 20 20" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">
            <path d="M6 7.4V2.9h8v4.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6"
                  stroke-linejoin="round"/>
            <path d="M6 14.2H4.2A1.6 1.6 0 0 1 2.6 12.6V9a1.6 1.6 0 0 1 1.6-1.6h11.6A1.6 1.6 0 0 1 17.4 9v3.6a1.6 1.6 0 0 1-1.6 1.6H14"
                  fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
            <path d="M6 11.8h8v5.3H6z" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6"
                  stroke-linejoin="round"/>
        </svg>
    </button>
</div>
